fields.value:
 * The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|followthrough}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* Applies a buff on self upon cast with the following properties:
*#** {{M|Disarm}}
*#** {{M|Mute}}
*#** {{M|Root}}
*#** {{Symbol|Turn Rate|Lock}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#*** Locks Pudge's {{M|facing angle}}.
*#*** Can only cast {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} targeted abilities in the direction he is facing.
*#** The duration is defined as:
*#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|MaxTravelDistance / HookSpeed × {{#var:Meat Hook basic2}}}}
*#*** The duration corresponds to the current {{Symbol|bonus cas}} max hook travel distance value, not the distance the current ability cast has traveled.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}}
*#* Affects units up to {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Meat Hook value1}}+{{#var:Meat Hook value2}}}}-distance with the travel distance and search radius.
*#* Can only affect units while extending, not while retracting.
*#** The unit search radius is centered around the hook's tip.
*#** Getting close to other parts of the hook {{M|projectile}} has no effect.
*#** Can travel through and pull affected units through or over {{M|impassable terrain}} and {{M|trees}}. 
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#* Upon [[projectile]] impact or latching on a valid unit, the latched unit is forcefully {{M|teleports}} to the ability cast location.
*#** The teleport component is no longer applied when the latched unit is affected by other {{M|forced movement}} sources.
*#* {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*#** Grants a 4-second 500-radius [[flying vision]] at the affected unit's location.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* {{M|Dispels}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|followthrough}} the buff upon latching on the following units:
*#** {{M|Fogged units}}.
*#** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*#** {{M|Runes}}, and then refunds the {{Symbol|mp cost}} mana cost utilizing {{M|mana restore}}.
*#** Does not affect the following units:
*#*** {{M|Ancient creeps}}.
*#*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*#*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Applies the {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}}, and is defined as:
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Base[[Spell Damage|SplDmg]] + {{ValueColor||{{#var:Meat Hook type3 value1 shd}}|shd|x}} × HookHitDistance}}
*#* {{M|Stuns}} the affected enemy unit for the entire pull duration.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*#* Forcefully {{M|teleports}}, but neither stuns nor damages the affected allied unit.
*#* {{cf|shdnotes}} 
*#** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#*** The {{M|cooldown reduction}} applied explicitly for this ability.

* Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|strong illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, {{M|illusion}} as creeps.
** {{M|Instant kill}} creeps utilizing the {{M|HP Removal}} mechanic.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Meat Hook icon0}}
| desc = Launches a bloody hook toward a unit or location. The hook will snag the first unit it encounters, dragging the unit back to Pudge, killing it if it's a non-ancient creep and dealing damage if it is an enemy otherwise.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
** Has a {{#var:Meat Hook basic1}}-[[projectile speed]]
** Can travel up to a max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:({{#var:Meat Hook cast range}}+{{#var:Meat Hook value2}})/{{#var:Meat Hook basic1}} round2}} seconds based on the affected unit's current location.

* {{Symbol|fx|s}}
** The ability sound effects are audible to everyone and even through the {{M|Fog of War}}.

