fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Toggle|On}}
** The ability's {{#var:Rot basic1}}-second damage interval is set for the whole game upon the first toggle on.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Toggling {{Symbol|Toggle|On}} {{Symbol|Toggle|Off}} does not interrupt Pudge's {{M|channeling}} abilities.
*** Continues to apply its ability effects when affected {{M|disable}} sources.
*** The self-damage ([[before reductions]]) is not lethal.
** {{Symbol|Aura}}
*** Creates a negative [[aura]] upon with the following properties:
**** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Rot basic1}}|v1={{#var:Rot value2}}}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} to affected units in {{#var:Rot basic1}}-second intervals within the radius, starting immediately upon debuff application.
*** Both the radius damage per second component and the self-damage component are independent of each other.
*** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|pudge_rot}}
**** Does not update the {{M|movement speed}} slow values on enemy units with the existing debuff.
**** {{Symbol|Toggle|Off}}
***** The lingering debuff only applies the movement speed slow component.

* Both leveling up the ability and acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} while toggled {{Symbol|Toggle|On}} immediately update the damage values {{ValueColor||and ability effects|agh}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Rot icon0}}
| desc = A toxic cloud that deals intense damage and slows movement--harming not only enemy units but Pudge himself.
}}

